{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415662","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415662","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041566201:1":{"text":"あら、ホーガン将軍の代わりに騎士団の業務を一時的に預かっているヴァレンさんではありませんか。","source_cn":"真巧，这不是替霍根将军暂时代管骑士团日常事务的维伦先生吗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E8DAEEC6E019A02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041566202:1":{"text":"そのながーい肩書きに一言申したいところだが……","source_cn":"确实，尽管我挺想反驳你那漫长的前缀的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2F0C7E1273B0BC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041566203:1":{"text":"それよりも、今はここで気持ちよく一杯飲みたい気分だからやめておくよ。","source_cn":"如果能选的话，我倒是更愿意一直留在这酒馆里，愉快地喝上一杯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06D37569555E379E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041566204:1":{"text":"ああそれと……お会いできて光栄です、イフリーさん。","source_cn":"——捎带一提，见到你很荣幸，伊芙小姐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13C39AF6730C3E0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041566205:1":{"text":"世間話の切り出しにしては、ややお粗末ですわね。","source_cn":"这好像不适合作为寒暄的开场白啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35549BBE45618CA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041566206:1":{"text":"今のところ、君と世間話をする必要性は感じられないのでね。","source_cn":"毕竟目前为止，我们也没有寒暄的必要。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4053E52A64D39FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041566207:1":{"text":"なら、こうしてお互いに探り合う必要性もないのではなくて？","source_cn":"那我们是不是也没有像这样互相试探的必要呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7935D734870F185","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041566208:1":{"text":"もちろんあるさ。君の言う「あのお方」が彼女――もしくは彼の謎めいたベールを外さない限り、君には相応の礼儀をもって接するべきだろう？","source_cn":"当然有，小姐。在您的那位大人尚未直接对我揭开她——或者...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53DB873A88560B8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041566209:1":{"text":"つまり、探りと遠回しな物言いがあなたの「礼儀」というわけですのね？","source_cn":"所以，你在把刺探和绕弯子作为礼貌？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBCB7F388C798FC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041566210:1":{"text":"見え透いた嘘と比べれば、十分礼儀正しい方だと思うぜ、お嬢さん。","source_cn":"比起确切不移的判断和大言不惭的谎言来说，这足够礼貌了，小姐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF027924FFCA498C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041566211:1":{"text":"少なくとも俺は、何も知らないお調子者のふりをして、君と無駄なお喋りはしていないだろ？","source_cn":"至少，我没有装作一无所知，伪装成一个浪荡子，说些浪费时...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B1F4D23E68CB721","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041566212:1":{"text":"あら、この会話も、十分時間の無駄だと思いますけど？","source_cn":"我们现在在说的难道不是浪费时间的废话吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED52FCE4FEB8EC8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伊芙":{"text":"イフリー","source":"伊芙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"ヴァレン","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":2}}